    <h2 class="about-section-title">Our Story</h2>
    <p class="about-section-sub">How Woofy came to be — and where we're headed.</p>

    <div class="story-content">
      <p>Founded by a team of dog lovers and pet industry experts, Woofy was born from a simple observation: choosing the right dog breed is one of the most important decisions a family can make. We wanted to create a platform that makes this decision easier, more informed, and ultimately more rewarding.</p>
      <p>Today, Woofy serves thousands of future pet owners every month, helping them discover the joy of responsible pet ownership through education and informed decision-making. We continue to grow our database, refine our search tools, and build a community of informed, passionate dog lovers.</p>
    </div>

